        "- $-1 < H'(\\bar{N}_1)H'(\\bar{N}_2) < 0$, hence the 2-cycle is oscillatory stable (green), \n",
        "- $H'(\\bar{N}_1)H'(\\bar{N}_2) < -1$, hence the 2-cycle is oscillatory unstable (red)."
